<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n92750" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥύαξ</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῠ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾱκος</span>, ὁ,
			</span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥέω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>rushing stream, mountain torrent</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				4.96
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				3.51
			</span></i>, prob. in <i><span class="en">
				<u>OGI</u>
				335.111
			</span></i> (Pergam., <span class="entity">ii B.C.</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> esp. <i>stream of lava</i> from a
			volcano, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ ῥ. τοῦ πυρὸς ἐκ τῆς Αἴτνης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					3.116
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phd.</u>
				111e
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				113b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mir.</u>
				833a17
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Lap.</u>
				22
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ καλούμενος ῥ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				14.59
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥ. ἀργύρου γενέσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					5.35
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b> of dolphins,
			etc., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔχει οἷον ῥ. δύο ἐξ ὧν τὸ
				γάλα ῥεῖ</span> two <i>flow-holes</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				504b24
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
